<div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold mb-0" style="letter-spacing: -2px;">
            <span style="font-weight: 300; color: #555;">歡迎使用MES系統</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-muted mt-4 fs-5 mx-auto reveal-text" style="max-width: 600px;">
            以嚴謹的後端邏輯與解耦思維，建構高可靠性的智慧製造系統。<br />
            專注於數據管理與跨系統介面整合。
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-5">
            <div class="card-ios h-100 transition-up">
                <div class="card-body p-5">
                    <div class="icon-box mb-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-database-fill-gear text-dark fs-1"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">主數據管理 (MDM)</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4 fs-6">具備完整的資料維護功能，支持批次處理與高效 CRUD 操作，是系統運行的基石。</p>

                    <div class="tech-stack mb-4">
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark rounded-pill border px-3">MSSQL</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark rounded-pill border px-3">C# / .NET</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark rounded-pill border px-3">Batch Processing</span>
                    </div>

                    <a href="@Url.Action("MasterData", "Projects")" class="btn btn-dark w-100 rounded-pill py-3 fw-bold">
                        進入系統 <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-5">
            <div class="card-ios h-100 transition-up">
                <div class="card-body p-5">
                    <div class="icon-box mb-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-terminal-split text-dark fs-1"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">API 介面模擬監控</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4 fs-6">模擬 Postman 的動態介面，演示非同步請求處理、JSON 資料綁定與後端驗證邏輯。</p>

                    <div class="tech-stack mb-4">
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark rounded-pill border px-3">Async/Await</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark rounded-pill border px-3">JSON.NET</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark rounded-pill border px-3">RESTful</span>
                    </div>

                    <a href="@Url.Action("ApiMonitor", "Projects")" class="btn btn-dark w-100 rounded-pill py-3 fw-bold">
                        開啟終端 <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>